{
    "title": "Gin Rummy - Classic Card Game",
    "description": "Gin Rummy is one of the most famous card games in the world. \r\n\r\nGin Rummy is a world-wide popular card game for 2 players. Form card sets and runs before your opponent does.\r\n\r\nStrategy and good planning will be key to master the game.\r\n\r\nDon't forget, always have a look at what your opponent is doing!\r\n\r\nHow to play?\r\n- Build your best hand by drawing or picking up one card at a time\r\n- Always have a look at your deadwood\r\n- When your deadwood is less than 10, knock\r\n- Take more risks to get more rewards by trying to get a Gin or even a Big Gin!\r\n- Reach 250 or 500 points to win!\r\n\r\nWhy choose Gin Rummy?\r\n\u2665 Tailored for mobile and tablet devices\r\n\u2663 Easy to play with a modern and relaxing look\r\n\u2666 Smart and adaptive opponent\u2019s AI\r\n\u2660 Customize your background and cards\r\n\u2665 Straight Gin game mode for more challenges \r\n\u2663 Smart tools to follow the cards that have been played\r\n\u2666 Auto save so that you can resume whenever you want\r\n\r\nGin Rummy is completely FREE to play, enjoy now hours of exciting card games!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Gin Rummy is one of the most famous card games in the world. <br><br>Gin Rummy is a world-wide popular card game for 2 players. Form card sets and runs before your opponent does.<br><br>Strategy and good planning will be key to master the game.<br><br>Don&#39;t forget, always have a look at what your opponent is doing!<br><br>How to play?<br>- Build your best hand by drawing or picking up one card at a time<br>- Always have a look at your deadwood<br>- When your deadwood is less than 10, knock<br>- Take more risks to get more rewards by trying to get a Gin or even a Big Gin!<br>- Reach 250 or 500 points to win!<br><br>Why choose Gin Rummy?<br>\u2665 Tailored for mobile and tablet devices<br>\u2663 Easy to play with a modern and relaxing look<br>\u2666 Smart and adaptive opponent\u2019s AI<br>\u2660 Customize your background and cards<br>\u2665 Straight Gin game mode for more challenges <br>\u2663 Smart tools to follow the cards that have been played<br>\u2666 Auto save so that you can resume whenever you want<br><br>Gin Rummy is completely FREE to play, enjoy now hours of exciting card games!",
